   115	
   116	`python3 docs/revision/followup2/cost_estimate.py`: 17.65 core-hours, 1.91 USD at the benchmark's 0.108 USD per
   117	core-hour; billed path on one 16-vCPU pod 3.56 hours (reproduction gate 0.61 h, searches, six serial reference calls,
