   145	deadline is the cap at the price ceiling MAXCPH, counted from the first creation request of the launch, so it holds across
   146	attempts; at the soft deadline the remote script stops before its next stage (a STOP file read between stages), and the
   147	driver's own admission check (`--cap-usd`, `--started-at`, `--attempts`) stops between stages or rounds as well. A running
   148	stage is never stopped (the author: do not kill jobs). The single exception is the watchdog, which deletes the pod at 1.3 x
